    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/online-learning-lms/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Online Learning LMS Theme is a responsive, modern, and feature-rich solution designed for educators, online tutors, schools, universities, training institutes, coaching centers, and e-learning platforms aiming to deliver digital education effectively. Ideal for building online academies, virtual classrooms, distance learning portals, professional certification sites, and course-based education platforms, it supports seamless course creation, management, and monetization. Learners can browse courses, enroll instantly, take quizzes, submit assignments, earn certificates, and track progress through interactive student dashboards. Built with SEO-friendly and optimized code, the theme ensures fast loading speed, smooth performance, and full responsiveness across desktops, tablets, and smartphones. It integrates essential plugins such as LearnPress or Tutor LMS for learning management, WooCommerce for selling courses, subscriptions, or memberships, Contact Form 7 for student inquiries, WPML for multilingual education websites, and Yoast SEO to improve search visibility. Advanced features like drip content scheduling, multi-instructor support, course prerequisites, lesson management, and discussion forums enhance learner engagement and instructor flexibility, making this free LMS theme perfect for professional online education websites focused on usability, conversions, and scalable learning experiences."
    },
